WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Use two questions to screen
the first workflows.

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:07.360
How easy is it to verify the result, and
how much authority does the system need?

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:11.680
Reviewed test drafts and evidence-linked
failure summaries can have bounded

00:00:11.724 --> 00:00:16.000
starting scopes. Multi-step
execution requires stronger controls

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:20.000
and recovery. Exploratory
ideas need expert judgment.

00:00:20.147 --> 00:00:24.720
Begin where a reviewer can recognize
a useful or incorrect result,

00:00:24.752 --> 00:00:26.880
then earn wider authority
through evidence.
